 "remarks": "Stylishly Renovated Victorian 2 bedroom duplex in the Heart of SONO  This fully reimagined 2 Bedroom Duplex blends timeless charm with today's modern finishes. Step inside to an open floor plan with sleek wood-look vinyl flooring, a designer kitchen featuring stainless steel appliances and plenty of space to entertain. The renovated apartment has an oversized second bedroom/office combo. Everything to be freshly painted in a contemporary palette, move right in and enjoy. A welcoming front porch after you park stress free with 2 reserved off-street spots. Prime SONO location: 1 block to the waterfront, 2 blocks to Metro North, and just steps to the best dining, shopping, and nightlife. Quick access to I-95 for an easy commute. Ask about longer term leases.  Only 1 month security with good credit Water, garbage, landscaping & parking included Pets welcome This one has it all modern updates, historic charm, and a walk-to-everything lifestyle!  Standard one year lease. Ask me about possible longer term options.",
